      "source": "<a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>JsonSchemaObject</code></a> implementation of <code>type : 'string'</code> schema elements.<br/>\nProvides programmatic access to schema specifics like minLength, maxLength, pattern,... via a fluent API\nproducing immutable <a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>schema objects</code></a>.",
      "translation": "针对 `type : 'string'` 模式元素的 `<code>JsonSchemaObject</code>` 接口实现。<br/>\n通过流式 API 提供对模式具体细节（如 minLength、maxLength、pattern 等）的程序化访问，生成不可变的<a href=\"JsonSchemaObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>模式对象</code></a>。",
