    {
      "source": "Create the JSON schema complying <code>Document</code> representation. This includes type,\ndescription and the fields of <code>UntypedJsonSchemaObject.Restrictions.toDocument()</code> if set.",
      "translation": "创建符合<code>Document</code>表示法的 JSON 架构。这包括类型、描述以及<code>UntypedJsonSchemaObject.Restrictions.toDocument()</code>设置时的字段。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create the JSON schema complying <code>Document</code> representation.",
      "translation": "```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"Document\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Unique identifier for the document\"\n    },\n    \"title\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Title of the document\"\n    },\n    \"content\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"$ref\": \"#/definitions/Block\"\n      },\n      \"description\": \"Array of content blocks\"\n    },\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"author\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"created_at\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"updated_at\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"id\", \"content\"],\n  \"definitions\": {\n    \"Block\": {\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/definitions/Paragraph\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/definitions/Image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/definitions/Heading\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"Paragraph\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"paragraph\"],\n          \"const\": \"paragraph\"\n        },\n        \"text\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"type\", \"text\"]\n    },\n    \"Image\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"image\"],\n          \"const\": \"image\"\n        },\n        \"src\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"uri\"\n        },\n        \"alt\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"type\", \"src\"]\n    },\n    \"Heading\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"heading\"],\n          \"const\": \"heading\"\n        },\n        \"level\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 6\n        },\n        \"text\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"type\", \"level\", \"text\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```",
      "count": 1
    },
